  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 302.10 Failure to Comply. Failure to provide any of the information required for the application shall result in denial of an application unless corrections are made within 5 business days of notification of any deficiencies by the JPP administrator.\n\nSource. #13270, eff 9-30-21; ss by #14624, eff 7-7-26, EXPIRES: 7-7-36",
